# Clicking empty map adds a waypoint; dragging does not.
#
# The claim this makes that a screenshot cannot: the mission actually grew, by the number of
# clicks, and a drag in the middle added nothing. And the clicks are waypoints 1 to 3, never home:
# what Save File writes has a home record at 0 - the Home Location boxes' home, or the blank one
# when they hold none - and the first click at 1 (GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:6108-6160).

screen plan
window 1600x1200
budget 4

# Nothing yet.
expect screen plan
expect mission.items 0

# Three still clicks on empty map.
# The map first: a press before its first paint records nothing.
expect map.ready true
click map@0.45x0.40
click map@0.55x0.45
click map@0.60x0.55
expect mission.items 3
expect mission.origin ~ edited
expect mission.written ~ ,1:3:16,2:3:16,3:3:16
